#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0581 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: None of TRTP, TRTPGy, TRTA, and TRTAGy are present and none of the character treatment variables in ADSL defined in the IG are present
#note "Only TRT02P is present, a member of TRTxxP (a period-2 dataset without TRT01P). Requirements.Variables.None lists TRTxxP, so the rule skips: a treatment variable of that family exists, and a BDS dataset need not carry the family's first member."
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col TRT02P type=Char
